  "term": "neurosignature",
  "definition": "A neurosignature is a characteristic pattern of brain-network activity or connectivity associated with a condition or process. In this source, it refers to a pattern that may show both shared disruption in pain and emotion regulation systems and distinct pathways for different disorders.",
